{
  "name": "dsh-api-proxy",
  "version": "1.0.2",
  "description": "DeepSeek Harness API 专用代理：导入 Clash 订阅，托管 mihomo 核心，只给指定 API 域名挂梯子。每次开启自动测速并连延迟最低的节点，可在设置里手动改选、开关免重启。可选接入机场「App 专属」节点：把厂商内核独立跑成本机上游，标准客户端握不上手的私有协议节点同样可用",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "proxy",
    "clash",
    "mihomo",
    "subscription",
    "socks5",
    "vpn"
  ],
  "author": "hutaodog",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/hutaodog/dsh-api-proxy.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/hutaodog/dsh-api-proxy#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/hutaodog/dsh-api-proxy/issues"
  },
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
